OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tue 11 Aug to Thu 20 AugFA
OL,6,Fsettled start, with mainly dry
OL,7,Fconditions on Tuesday, although with
OL,8,Fscattered showers across western
OL,9,Fareas. Then through the week, more
OL,10,Fchangeable changeable conditions are
OL,11,Flikely across northern parts, with
OL,12,Fsome spells of rain or showers and
OL,13,Fstronger winds, interspersed by drier
OL,14,Fperiods. Whilst southern areas will
OL,15,Fgenerally see more settled, drier
OL,16,Fconditions where it will become very
OL,17,Fwarm or hot. Further into August,
OL,18,Flower pressure may start to track
OL,19,Ffurther south south or east. This
OL,20,Fmeans there is a greater chance of
OL,21,Ffrontal systems or thundery interludes
OL,22,Fto affect southern and eastern areas
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,23,Fin comparison to recent weeks, though
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
OL,24,Frainfall amounts could be quite
OL,25,Fvariable with some areas still seeing
OL,26,Frelatively little. Temperatures look
